### 思路



![时刻一萃香在左、大瓜在右，下一刻双方交换格子；只检查每个时刻最终同格，图示方案始终安全。](assets/core7/P3786.svg)

预存每时刻每格是否危险、出现哪个可收集西瓜。$f$[格子][集合]记录当前时刻安全抵达并收集这些西瓜的最少移动；下一刻可原地或到四邻格，只检查新时刻目的格，安全后并入该格小西瓜。初始在给定格检查危险并收集，费用零；一直推到最后时刻，再在已集齐状态中取最小。

轨迹总输入量为Q，时间 $O(Q+Thw2^m)$，空间 $O(Thw+hw2^m)$。

### 参考代码

```cpp
#include <bits/stdc++.h>
using namespace std;

int main() {
    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);
    cin.tie(nullptr);
    int h, w, total, sx, sy;
    cin >> h >> w >> total >> sx >> sy;
    int n, m;
    cin >> n >> m;
    int cells = h * w;
    vector<vector<char>> danger(total + 1, vector<char>(cells));
    vector<vector<int>> fruit(total + 1, vector<int>(cells));
    int fruitIndex = 0;
    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
        int begin, end, small;
        cin >> begin >> end >> small;
        int bit = small ? 1 << fruitIndex++ : 0;
        for (int t = begin; t < end; t++) {
            int x, y;
            cin >> x >> y;
            int p = (y - 1) * w + x - 1;
            if (small)
                fruit[t][p] |= bit;
            else
                danger[t][p] = true;
        }
    }
    int start = (sy - 1) * w + sx - 1;
    if (danger[1][start]) {
        cout << -1 << '\n';
        return 0;
    }
    vector<vector<int>> neighbors(cells);
    for (int u = 0; u < cells; u++)
        for (int v = 0; v < cells; v++)
            if (abs(u / w - v / w) + abs(u % w - v % w) <= 1)
                neighbors[u].push_back(v);
    int states = 1 << m, INF = 1000000000;
    vector<int> dp(cells * states, INF), next(cells * states, INF);
    dp[start * states + fruit[1][start]] = 0;
    for (int t = 2; t <= total; t++) {
        fill(next.begin(), next.end(), INF);
        for (int u = 0; u < cells; u++)
            for (int mask = 0; mask < states; mask++)
                if (dp[u * states + mask] < INF) {
                    for (int v : neighbors[u])
                        if (!danger[t][v]) {
                            int target = v * states + (mask | fruit[t][v]);
                            next[target] = min(next[target], dp[u * states + mask] + (u != v));
                        }
                }
        dp.swap(next);
    }
    int answer = INF;
    for (int p = 0; p < cells; p++)
        answer = min(answer, dp[p * states + states - 1]);
    cout << (answer == INF ? -1 : answer) << '\n';
    return 0;
}
```

### 易错点

第一刻检查起点且不移动；仅检查同时到达后的格子；目标位表示已收集；集齐也要活到最后；无小西瓜仍需避险；坐标$x$是列。

## P3947. 肝活动

> 原题：[P3947](https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P3947)
> 解法：集合确定已用时间，最优后缀的排名确定字典序 · C++17

### 题意

每首歌恰好完成一次，得分为开放剩余时间减完成时刻与零的较大值；在活动期限内达到目标，输出最高分和字典序最小的完整歌名序列，否则输出No Answer。

