### 思路



![原样例合格者为10、12、18；11的位和二不能整除十一，当前前缀位和不能拿来替代最终模数。](assets/core7/P4127.svg)

先枚举最终数位和$s$，使“模自身数位和”变成模固定$s$。预处理$ways[len][sum][r]$：长len的可含前导零后缀，数位和sum、余数$r$的个数。扫描每个上界的第一次变小位，已定前缀$v$、数位和$h$后，查询剩余和$s$减$h$以及余数负$v$乘十的剩余位次方。两端共用同一张后缀表，最后相减。

设D为位数、S为九乘D，时间 $O(10D\sum_{s=1}^{S}s^2)$，空间 $O(DS^2)$。

### 参考代码

```cpp
#include <bits/stdc++.h>
using namespace std;

int main() {
    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);
    cin.tie(nullptr);
    long long low, high;
    cin >> low >> high;
    string a = to_string(low - 1), b = to_string(high);
    int digits = b.size();
    vector<int> left(digits), right(digits);
    for (int i = 0; i < int(a.size()); i++)
        left[digits - a.size() + i] = a[i] - '0';
    for (int i = 0; i < digits; i++)
        right[i] = b[i] - '0';
    long long answer = 0;
    for (int target = 1; target <= 9 * digits; target++) {
        int width = target + 1, layer = width * target;
        vector<long long> ways(digits * layer);
        ways[0] = 1;
        vector<array<int, 10>> nextRemainder(target);
        for (int r = 0; r < target; r++)
            for (int d = 0; d < 10; d++)
                nextRemainder[r][d] = (r * 10 + d) % target;
        vector<int> power10(digits, 1 % target);
        for (int len = 1; len < digits; len++)
            power10[len] = power10[len - 1] * 10 % target;
        for (int len = 0; len + 1 < digits; len++) {
            for (int sum = 0; sum <= min(target, 9 * len); sum++)
                for (int r = 0; r < target; r++) {
                    long long count = ways[len * layer + sum * target + r];
                    if (!count)
                        continue;
                    for (int d = 0; d <= 9 && sum + d <= target; d++)
                        ways[(len + 1) * layer + (sum + d) * target + nextRemainder[r][d]] += count;
                }
        }
        auto prefix = [&](const vector<int> &bound) {
            long long count = 0;
            int sum = 0, remainder = 0;
            for (int pos = 0; pos < digits; pos++) {
                int len = digits - pos - 1;
                for (int d = 0; d < bound[pos]; d++) {
                    int need = target - sum - d;
                    if (need < 0 || need > 9 * len)
                        continue;
                    int head = nextRemainder[remainder][d];
                    int tail = (target - head * power10[len] % target) % target;
                    count += ways[len * layer + need * target + tail];
                }
                sum += bound[pos];
                remainder = nextRemainder[remainder][bound[pos]];
                if (sum > target)
                    return count;
            }
            return count + (sum == target && remainder == 0);
        };
        answer += prefix(right) - prefix(left);
    }
    cout << answer << '\n';
    return 0;
}
```

### 易错点

先固定最终数位和再取模；十九位上界；数零不计；补零不改变数位和；前缀与后缀通过十的幂合成余数；同一$s$表供两端共用；六十四位计数。

## P5128. 好时光

> 原题：[P5128](https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P5128)
> 解法：按最长段的阈值累加，用后两位批量更新等差后缀 · C++17

### 题意

把一至$n$写成$k$进制，求每个表示中最长连续等差数码段的长度之和，模19260821；$n$可达$k$的十八次方。

