### 参考代码

```cpp
#include <bits/stdc++.h>
using namespace std;

int main() {
    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);
    cin.tie(nullptr);
    int n, k;
    cin >> n >> k;
    vector<pair<long long, int>> beads;
    beads.reserve(n);
    for (int color = 0; color < k; color++) {
        int count;
        cin >> count;
        while (count--) {
            long long position;
            cin >> position;
            beads.push_back({position, color});
        }
    }
    sort(beads.begin(), beads.end());
    vector<int> count(k);
    int covered = 0, left = 0;
    long long answer = LLONG_MAX;
    for (int right = 0; right < n; right++) {
        if (count[beads[right].second]++ == 0)
            ++covered;
        while (covered == k) {
            answer = min(answer, beads[right].first - beads[left].first);
            if (--count[beads[left].second] == 0)
                --covered;
            ++left;
        }
    }
    cout << answer << '\n';
    return 0;
}
```

### 易错点

按坐标而非输入颜色分块处理；计数保留同色多颗；失去最后一颗才减少covered；长度是坐标差；同坐标可为零；不加一。

## P6503. DIFERENCIJA

> 原题：[P6503](https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P6503)
> 解法：极差总和等于所有最大值贡献减所有最小值贡献 · C++17

### 题意

求每个连续子数组的最大值减最小值，再把所有子数组结果相加。

