### 思路



![红段不含一，绿色端点段为一三一，两类只有各一个；将绿色中间的三改二会拆开无二块。](assets/core7/P14379.svg)

不贡献的区间恰有两类：整段没有1；或两端都是1且整段没有2。第一类按相邻1之间空隙长度$g$计$g$选二，第二类按相邻2之间块里1的数量$c$计$c$选二。两类互斥，用全部$n$选二减去它们。树状数组维护1、2的位置频次，并用非负频次上的第$k$项搜索找邻居；修改只影响拆分或合并的相邻块及其中1的数量。

初始化 $O(n)$，每次修改 $O(\log n)$，空间 $O(n)$。

### 参考代码

```cpp
#include <bits/stdc++.h>
using namespace std;
struct Fenwick {
    int n;
    vector<int> tree;
    explicit Fenwick(int size) : n(size), tree(size + 1) {}
    void add(int p, int v) {
        for (; p <= n; p += p & -p)
            tree[p] += v;
    }
    int sum(int p) const {
        int value = 0;
        for (; p; p -= p & -p)
            value += tree[p];
        return value;
    }
    int kth(int k) const {
        int p = 0;
        for (int step = 1 << 20; step; step >>= 1) {
            int q = p + step;
            if (q <= n && tree[q] < k) {
                p = q;
                k -= tree[q];
            }
        }
        return p + 1;
    }
};
int main() {
    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);
    cin.tie(nullptr);
    int n, q;
    cin >> n >> q;
    vector<int> a(n + 1);
    Fenwick ones(n), twos(n);
    long long noOne = 0, twoFree = 0;
    int gap = 0, count = 0;
    auto choose = [](long long x) { return x * (x - 1) / 2; };
    for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {
        cin >> a[i];
        if (a[i] == 1) {
            ones.tree[i] = 1;
            noOne += choose(gap);
            gap = 0;
            ++count;
        } else
            ++gap;
        if (a[i] == 2) {
            twos.tree[i] = 1;
            twoFree += choose(count);
            count = 0;
        }
    }
    noOne += choose(gap);
    twoFree += choose(count);
    for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {
        int j = i + (i & -i);
        if (j <= n) {
            ones.tree[j] += ones.tree[i];
            twos.tree[j] += twos.tree[i];
        }
    }
    int numberOne = ones.sum(n), numberTwo = twos.sum(n);
    auto neighbors = [&](const Fenwick &bit, int total, int p, bool present) {
        int before = bit.sum(p - 1);
        int l = before ? bit.kth(before) : 0;
        int nextRank = before + 1 + present;
        int r = nextRank <= total ? bit.kth(nextRank) : n + 1;
        return pair<int, int>{l, r};
    };
    auto change = [&](int p, int value, int delta) {
        if (value == 1) {
            auto [l, r] = neighbors(ones, numberOne, p, delta == -1);
            long long split = choose(p - l - 1) + choose(r - p - 1) - choose(r - l - 1);
            noOne += delta * split;
            auto [left, right] = neighbors(twos, numberTwo, p, false);
            int c = ones.sum(right - 1) - ones.sum(left);
            twoFree += delta == 1 ? c : -(c - 1);
            ones.add(p, delta);
            numberOne += delta;
        } else if (value == 2) {
            auto [l, r] = neighbors(twos, numberTwo, p, delta == -1);
            int middle = ones.sum(p);
            long long left = middle - ones.sum(l), right = ones.sum(r - 1) - middle;
            twoFree -= delta * left * right;
            twos.add(p, delta);
            numberTwo += delta;
        }
    };
    while (q--) {
        int p, value;
        cin >> p >> value;
        int oldCategory = min(a[p], 3), newCategory = min(value, 3);
        if (oldCategory != newCategory) {
            change(p, oldCategory, -1);
            change(p, newCategory, 1);
        }
        a[p] = value;
        cout << choose(n) - noOne - twoFree << '\n';
    }
    return 0;
}
```

### 易错点

正整数MEX；只计长度至少二；无一与双一无二两类互斥；其它高度同类；先删旧再加新；第$k$项要求非负频次与合法$k$；哨兵不入树；组合数六十四位。

## CF1194E. Count The Rectangles

> 原题：[CF1194E](https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/CF1194E)
> 解法：枚举上下两条横线，统计同时贯穿它们的竖线 · C++17

### 题意

给定水平或垂直线段，同方向线段互不相交，数选四段能围成轴对齐矩形的方案，端点相接也算相交。

